#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:1
msgid "Release 0.6 (2004-11-14)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:3
msgid "Rewrite of the normalisation engine."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:5
msgid "Multiple builds can now be performed in parallel (option `-j`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:7
msgid ""
"Distributed builds. Nix can now call a shell script to forward builds to Nix "
"installations on remote machines, which may or may not be of the same "
"platform type."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:11
msgid "Option `--fallback` allows recovery from broken substitutes."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:13
msgid ""
"Option `--keep-going` causes building of other (unaffected) derivations to "
"continue if one failed."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:16
msgid ""
"Improvements to the garbage collector (i.e., it should actually work now)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:19
msgid ""
"Setuid Nix installations allow a Nix store to be shared among multiple users."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:22
msgid "Substitute registration is much faster now."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:24
msgid ""
"A utility `nix-build` to build a Nix expression and create a symlink to the "
"result int the current directory; useful for testing Nix derivations."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:28
msgid "Manual updates."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:30
msgid "`nix-env` changes:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:32
msgid ""
"Derivations for other platforms are filtered out (which can be overridden "
"using `--system-filter`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:35
msgid ""
"`--install` by default now uninstall previous derivations with the same name."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:38
msgid "`--upgrade` allows upgrading to a specific version."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:40
msgid ""
"New operation `--delete-generations` to remove profile generations "
"(necessary for effective garbage collection)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:43
msgid "Nicer output (sorted, columnised)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:45
msgid ""
"More sensible verbosity levels all around (builder output is now shown "
"always, unless `-Q` is given)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:48
msgid "Nix expression language changes:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:50
msgid ""
"New language construct: "
"`with                                                 "
"E1;                                                 E2` brings all "
"attributes defined in the attribute set _E1_ in scope in _E2_."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:55
msgid "Added a `map` function."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:57
msgid "Various new operators (e.g., string concatenation)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:59
msgid "Expression evaluation is much faster."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:61
msgid ""
"An Emacs mode for editing Nix expressions (with syntax highlighting and "
"indentation) has been added."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.6.md:64
msgid "Many bug fixes."
msgstr ""
